{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "story_mudrok_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_mudrok_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "在卡兹戴尔",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_mudrok_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "67ed957e5a78ac9dd5da8fb10450f22bb3420d8f5877618ada53b06a72d36f4f",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "鲍勃，关于你在上次的信中慷慨提出的那个建议，我曾经认真想过，但最终还是决定心领你的好意，暂时不前往哥伦比亚。\n我们最终决定在卡兹戴尔外围的一处聚落驻扎下来，暂时歇一歇脚。\n没错，我们走了很长很长的路，在距离卡兹戴尔一步之遥的地方停了下来，又下决心掉头离开。\n可我们犹豫、思考、争吵......兜兜转转，没进卡兹戴尔，但也没能走掉，谁也说不清为什么。\n也许我仍然没想好。\n也许卡兹戴尔发生了一些好的变化，但没有变好太多。\n也许只是因为大多数人都已经无力再开启一次长途跋涉，我也一样。\n对了，有件稍微有点难以启齿的事情，不大，但可能会给你添些麻烦，甚至有些得寸进尺。\n我不知道这是否包含在你的业务范围内，所以提前说声抱歉......我是说，如果方便的话......我和我的同伴们......\n还想买一些啤酒。\n至少在安魂节那天，我们希望参加卡兹戴尔城外的化装游行。如果能在同时喝上一些啤酒，那就再好不过了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "咳、咳......呛死了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱塔尼亚感染者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你戴着面罩呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "面罩又不防尘。于尔根，要找茬找丽扎去，你看她捂得多严实。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯术师",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱塔尼亚感染者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "泥岩，你回来了！信寄出去了吗？能不能确保在安魂节前拿到啤酒？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯术师",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "泥岩，啤酒的事怎么说？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "泥岩？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "信使不在，我只能把信交给罗德岛办事处，让他们转交。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱塔尼亚感染者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这下时间又要拖得更长了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯术师",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "卡兹戴尔附近真的连一瓶啤酒都找不到吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（耸肩）不然泥岩为什么特意给大鲍勃写信？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱塔尼亚感染者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不行，既然说了要在安魂节喝啤酒，就得说到做到。我们得自己动手了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们自己动手......酿酒？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "别听他瞎吹了，酿酒哪有那么简单。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱塔尼亚感染者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "谁瞎吹了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱塔尼亚感染者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "酿酒本来也不难。先把大麦泡在水里发麦芽，然后把麦芽煮开过滤，把啤酒花加进去，最后发酵就行了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯术师",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "别的材料都有，但啤酒花......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可以去附近找。这家伙不是说酿酒不难吗，他肯定知道啤酒花是什么样的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱塔尼亚感染者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我当然知道！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱塔尼亚感染者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不过你们怎么都积极起来了？刚刚不是还说我瞎吹——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "少废话，于尔根，我这就去跟大家说酿酒的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯术师",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "听见了吗，于尔根？事情已经定了，你可得说话算话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱塔尼亚感染者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊，这个嘛，哈哈哈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我会帮你一起做的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "大家都会一起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "数日后"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱塔尼亚感染者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......不对，这个和啤酒花差得远。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这个呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱塔尼亚感染者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（嗅嗅）也不对。这个闻起来就酸得要命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱塔尼亚感染者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "卡兹戴尔这个地方——我是说，我们扎营这个地方，附近的植被可真够贫瘠的，和你在路上讲的不一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可我好像......没说过卡兹戴尔有很多茂密的植被。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是不是其他人说过这样的话？好像是在冬灵山脉附近，一个雪夜......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，没什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱塔尼亚感染者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哦，对。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱塔尼亚感染者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那天恰好下了场雪，我们饿得要命，可地里的野萝卜都被附近村子里的人拔光了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱塔尼亚感染者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在破房子里发抖的时候，安娅起的话头，说卡兹戴尔肯定不至于连野萝卜都不长，然后把我们能想到的好地方说了个遍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱塔尼亚感染者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "植被茂密的丘陵、密林、河谷间的沃土......哦，当然了，还有麦田和啤酒花。那怎么可能是卡兹戴尔呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "于尔根，如果你想进卡兹戴尔——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱塔尼亚感染者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "也不是进不去，我知道。可搞得跟做贼似的，也太没意思了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱塔尼亚感染者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这个不对，这个也不对——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱塔尼亚感染者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈哈，真是说什么来什么！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这是......野萝卜？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱塔尼亚感染者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "野萝卜，而且有这么多！原来卡兹戴尔还真有这东西啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱塔尼亚感染者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "*莱塔尼亚粗口*，连野萝卜都有，怎么就是没有啤酒花啊，真的是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们还是先接着找吧——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱塔尼亚感染者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等等，泥岩，别动。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱塔尼亚感染者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你头顶上落了个小球果。我来拿，别让它掉下来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱塔尼亚感染者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "拿到了。让我闻闻......这个味道......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱塔尼亚感染者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就这个吧，这个说不定行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "十数日后"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯术师",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "泥岩，你怎么来了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "大家都想知道啤酒怎么样了，我就来看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯术师",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "还能怎么样，接着发酵呗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯术师",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "于尔根那家伙还不算个彻头彻尾的草包，发麦芽和煮麦汁都像模像样，可一到发酵就挠头了，还得我来替他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我还以为小队里只剩他一个懂酿酒的人了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯术师",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "忘了我了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你——唔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是的，你在雪原上酿过很好喝的野莓酒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯术师",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我还以为你忘了呢。野莓酒......那可是好几年前了，当时我们还是整合运动呢，是不是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯，你当时是“甜嘴红牙的丽扎”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯术师",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈，这么快就想起来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯术师",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不就是喜欢喝点没那么烈的甜酒嘛，怎么就“甜嘴”了？我很油嘴滑舌吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯术师",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“红牙”倒是很贴切。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我记得你的牙齿，经常被野莓染成红的——虽然你总是戴着面罩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯术师",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈哈哈，彼此彼此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯术师",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不过，大家能相互起外号、开玩笑，喝了酒也不会打起来的时间，好像很快就过去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯术师",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你也是那个时候决定要走的，对不对？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一开始，整合运动很像雪原上一栋壁炉里火焰熊熊的房子，很像一个......家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可后来，它变得更像是一辆熊熊燃烧的战车，笔直地朝前冲，不管是雪、是草木，还是土石......都会被烤焦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯术师",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这就是为什么除了你的萨卡兹老伙计，还会有几个平时就不合群的乌萨斯人跟着你一起离开。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯术师",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "像于尔根和安娅这些莱塔尼亚人，也是因为有你，才会跟着我们一路走过来的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......抱歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯术师",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "道什么歉啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯术师",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我知道，你希望卡兹戴尔成为我们所有人的家，我们却连安魂节活动都只能参加城外的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯术师",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可是那又怎么样？我们这些有家不能回的人到卡兹戴尔做客，做很长很长时间......不也挺好的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯术师",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就像这次安魂节，归根到底，还不是因为安娅——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯术师",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啧，这破发酵桶又漏气了。我来补上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯术师",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "糟了，气太多了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我也来帮忙！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯术师",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不行，发酵桶不能沾土！还得我来——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯术师",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "毡帽这个混蛋，他找的什么破桶！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯术师",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "泥岩，你没事吧——哦，你捂得比我严实。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯术师",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哼，下次我也找身盔甲穿穿，先从面罩开始，我看毡帽那个就不错......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯术师",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "泥岩？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好香。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯术师",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你这么一说......是啊，好香。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不过，我们的原料......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯术师",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "放心，麦芽再发就好，至于那个代用啤酒花，于尔根私藏了一大堆，我心里有数。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "私藏？做什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯术师",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你肯定猜不到——他拿那东西做枕芯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯术师",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他在那东西上睡觉睡得特别死，呼噜打得震天响。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯术师",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "对了，要来点莓果吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "莓果？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯术师",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "买酵母的时候顺便从商队手里换的。本想着啤酒酿好了就酿野莓酒，可这东西根本不甜，只好拿来吃着玩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "说着，乌萨斯女性把面罩掀起一个小角，往嘴里塞了一颗莓果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯术师",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啧，一点味道都没有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯术师",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "还是雪原上的莓果好吃啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "数十日后\n安魂节当日"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "泥岩，游行马上开始，我们得准备起来了。于尔根和丽扎怎么说？啤酒酿成了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "马上就见分晓了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "以防万一，大鲍勃呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "还是没消息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......行吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你怎么还站在原地？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我在想......卡兹戴尔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "有什么好想的，大炉子就在那边杵着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但这座卡兹戴尔......和我们一路向往的那个地方，真的一样吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "明摆着不一样啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "尤其是那个安娅，她在路上简直把卡兹戴尔吹上了天，我听着都脸红。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不过要是卡兹戴尔真变成了那么个地方，我倒是蛮想去里面住两天——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "先回营地吧。我已经等不及要喝啤酒了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱塔尼亚感染者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯术师",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "其他泥岩小队成员",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......失败了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱塔尼亚感染者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "倒也没有，就是，该怎么说呢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯术师",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "别想怎么说了，直接把我们的杰作端出来吧。给，先来一小杯尝尝味道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好香的——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......醋啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯术师",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "噗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱塔尼亚感染者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你居然笑？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯术师",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不然呢？哭一场？你觉得安娅想看你哭？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱塔尼亚感染者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "安娅她——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "莱塔尼亚人恶狠狠地盯着眼前整合运动装束的队友——\n——冷不防从泥岩手里夺回杯子，一口气把醋喝干。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "于尔根！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱塔尼亚感染者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "泥岩，没事，我好得很——咳！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱塔尼亚感染者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "丽扎，告诉你，今天我还就要到卡兹戴尔去，到城外的游行队伍里......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱塔尼亚感染者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......喝气泡醋！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "紧绷的空气一下子松动了，人群中传出零星的笑声。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "泥岩？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就像于尔根说的，我们先带着安娅，带着我们的“啤酒”......去卡兹戴尔吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "遗憾啊，我还以为真能喝上啤酒了呢。大鲍勃呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "天快黑了，我们没时间再等他了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "各位，准备一下，我们要去卡兹戴尔了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "今天是安魂节，城外会有化装活动，希望各位也尽量......呃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "发挥想象力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不知道其他化装的萨卡兹会不会对我们有意见，所以，各位还是尽量打扮成萨卡兹的样子比较好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我和其他萨卡兹会给你们打头阵的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲林队员",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看我做的假角，是不是很逼真？来来来，没准备的都到我这来领！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯队员",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这什么破做工，根本戴不到耳朵上！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲林队员",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我做工好得很！是你耳朵太圆了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡普里尼队员",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那我怎么办？我不要磨角啊！很痛的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹队员",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "化装，化装！你戴个兜帽什么的不就结了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃拉菲亚队员",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我听说城里还有打扮成萨科塔的呢。给，这个光圈你别在头上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹队员",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "咻，*萨卡兹粗口*，这东西够亮！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡兹戴尔外围居民A",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看，泥岩他们也来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡兹戴尔外围居民B",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他们那儿真有这么多萨卡兹吗？那个人头上的角......是不是歪了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡兹戴尔外围居民B",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "还有那个从兜帽里戳出来的角，一看就是卡普里尼的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹队员",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘿，别看他们，看我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡兹戴尔外围居民A",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哦，是你呀，你这个正牌萨卡兹！挤在人群里不说，头顶还戴个光圈！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡兹戴尔外围居民B",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这是不是会有点——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡兹戴尔外围居民A",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "管那么多呢，头上有角，当然是萨卡兹！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡兹戴尔外围居民B",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她没角——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡兹戴尔外围居民A",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那叫模仿整合运动模仿得逼真！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯术师",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "还是你识货！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯术师",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "来，喝一口这个，保证让你惊掉下巴！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡兹戴尔外围居民A",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啤酒？气泡还这么足？我可好长时间没喝了，快给我来一口——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡兹戴尔外围居民A",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "噗——酸的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "游行的人群",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈哈哈哈哈哈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "因为种种理由不愿进，或是不能进入城市的萨卡兹们都注意到了这支队伍。\n条件所限，泥岩小队大多数人的化装实在过于容易识破。\n但在这个晚上，没人愿意去戳穿这些。\n他们宁愿相信这些异族人和自己一样，走过了长长的回家路，最终回到了他们的家乡......\n回到了卡兹戴尔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱塔尼亚感染者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈哈哈......嗝！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "于尔根，行了，别再一口接一口地往肚子里灌醋了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱塔尼亚感染者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "醋又怎么了，我说它是啤酒，它就是啤酒！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "于尔根......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱塔尼亚感染者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗨，泥岩！今天晚上真开心啊，是不是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱塔尼亚感染者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "安娅，你说呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "时间也不早了，我们也该做最后一件事了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱塔尼亚感染者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "最后......一件事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们......去卡兹戴尔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱塔尼亚感染者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "算了吧，安娅不也说了，别为了她一个人跟整个城市对着干......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "没事的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "把安娅......给我吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "泥岩接过莱塔尼亚人递来的骨灰罐。\n她站在原地。\n夜晚的风声嘈杂，而她沉默地站在那里，像风中的岩石。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "谁规定只有那座永不停歇的熔炉才意味着卡兹戴尔？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "土石、泥沼、沙砾......也许那些更平静、更宽阔、更安宁的地方，才是我们的卡兹戴尔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "才是我们的家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "人群安静下来，他们静静地等待着。\n直到泥岩将骨灰罐放下，喃喃地对着大地说了些什么。\n直到大地微微颤动，雀跃的土石回应呼唤，像泥岩在回家路上无数次请求的那样，堆砌成一座火炉的形状。\n直到这座一人高的炉中堆起柴薪，生起温和的火焰，其中没有哀叹，没有怒吼，只有干柴噼啪作响。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "泥岩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "泥岩！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这声音是......？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "原来你们都跑这儿来了，可让我找得好苦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好久不见，泥岩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......鲍勃？！真的是你——你真的来了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "路上耽搁了点时间，不过总算卡着时间赶到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你们的营地里一个人都没有，我还怕是出了什么事，幸亏我当赏金猎人时的本事还没全忘——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "鲍勃！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯术师",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "大鲍勃，你真的来了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "当然来了。泥岩小队要喝啤酒，我还能不帮帮场子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱塔尼亚感染者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你就是......大鲍勃？你真的把啤酒......送来了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哟，新人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "没错，我给你们送啤酒来了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "鲍勃农场精酿，农场主亲自派送，泥岩小队人人有份。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不过看这架势，现在好像不是喝酒的时候？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，不......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "鲍勃，时间正好，现在......正是喝啤酒的时候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "泥岩将骨灰罐打开，一位行了长路的战士的骨骸落入火中。\n接着，她从大鲍勃手中接过一瓶啤酒。\n金黄色的酒液泛着泡沫，引得炉火发出几声清脆的爆鸣，像是未能赶上安魂夜游行的同伴的笑声。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯术师",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（吸鼻子）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯术师",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呛死了，是不是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......早都说过了，我的面罩......不防尘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱塔尼亚感染者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱塔尼亚感染者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "安娅......安娅......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱塔尼亚感染者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呜......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "泥岩小队里传来低泣，而未散的游行人群也聚集到炉边。\n看着熊熊的炉火，每个人都想起了一些本该在这里，却未能到达此处的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱塔尼亚感染者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......鲍勃，还有啤酒吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "还有的是呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱塔尼亚感染者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "给我来一瓶！不能让安娅一个人偷着喝！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "大家......都来领酒吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡兹戴尔外围居民A",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那个，要是啤酒有多余的话......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "拿着！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "反正制冷的源石器件也在路上坏了，你们不喝，我还愁泥岩小队没人喝得下这么多呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "泪水很快就被酒精下肚带来的热量烤干。\n紧闭的双唇终于张开，微醺的脸上泛起酡红，抽泣化作歌声，歌声又变成热烈的交谈。\n啤酒花的芬芳弥漫向黑夜中熟睡的远方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱塔尼亚感染者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "泥岩！既然你能用土石做庇护所，做巨像，那你能不能用土石做些更有......呃......诗意的事情？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "诗意？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱塔尼亚感染者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "比如——把卡兹戴尔周围的荒地全变成肥得能攥出油来的黑土——变成......麦田！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯术师",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "变成莓果园！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我投麦田一票。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱塔尼亚感染者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你看——你看！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯术师",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "毡帽，你可想好了，于尔根只会酿气泡醋，要是有了莓果园，我保证让你每天都有野莓酒喝！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "欢乐的人群",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "野莓酒！野莓酒！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "鲍勃，谢谢你，多谢你能来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，我觉得就算没这些啤酒，哪怕是喝醋，今晚也已经是个温暖的安魂节了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "还有，抱歉，我之前在信中说要去哥伦比亚探望你，结果却是你先来了卡兹戴尔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不也挺好吗？哥伦比亚有麦田，有啤酒花，可也有烟酒施术单元以及源石制品管理局。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "烟酒......什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一句话，查税的，最近越来越烦人了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我本来也想找个人把酒给你们送来算了，可查税的实在烦得我受不了，再加上怕别人出岔子，就换我自己来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "反正你之前也找我要过啤酒花的标本，不如我亲自给你送一车啤酒来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那你回去之后......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "谁知道呢，那群查税的可凶得很，说不定我一回去就要进局子了呢，哈哈！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈哈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那你呢，要在这里一直住下去吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不。总有一天，我们会离开，我们会反抗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "反抗谁？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "乌萨斯的领主，莱塔尼亚的贵族......还不够。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那可太好了，能把烟酒施术单元以及源石制品管理局也加进去吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（微笑）假如我们真去哥伦比亚的话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但我们不得不反抗的东西，可能比看得见摸得着的东西......要难对付得多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "两人沉默下来，而在距离火炉更近的地方，人们的说笑声仍然不绝于耳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但现在，我们带着记忆和梦，活着，笑着，这就是我们最渺小的反抗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在我们所有人的家乡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泥岩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在卡兹戴尔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
